{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52654","headline":"同前 · 黄土县尉","name":"同前","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"□□□幽□，携樽玩桂□。\n□□□□□，□□□□□。\n□□□□□，□□□□□。\n□□□月□，欺曲彩云中。\n□□□□□，合□□□□。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄土县尉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}